    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jaeger is a third-person MOBA game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Character Class </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from six distinct character classes: <strong>Sharpshooter, Berserker, Defender, Elementalist, Healer, and Assassin</strong>. Each class features a <strong>unique weapon and specialized skills</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Classic Leveling System ( Player Stats ) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As players <strong>level up</strong>, they can freely allocate <strong>stat points</strong> and <strong>learn new skills</strong> to customize their character. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Weapons with Skills </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each weapon boasts <strong>unique skills</strong> and specific requirements. Players can <strong>purchase weapons during a match</strong>.    </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jaeger is a third-person MOBA game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Character Class </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from six distinct character classes: <strong>Sharpshooter, Berserker, Defender, Elementalist, Healer, and Assassin</strong>. Each class features a <strong>unique weapon and specialized skills</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Classic Leveling System ( Player Stats ) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As players <strong>level up</strong>, they can freely allocate <strong>stat points</strong> and <strong>learn new skills</strong> to customize their character. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Weapons with Skills </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each weapon boasts <strong>unique skills</strong> and specific requirements. Players can <strong>purchase weapons during a match</strong>.    </p>",
